WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.485 --> 00:00:13.386
Monday was Show-and-Tell Day in Brandy's class.

2
00:00:14.547 --> 00:00:17.569
Each week five students brought something to class.

3
00:00:18.989 --> 00:00:21.931
They showed it to their classmates and told them about it.

4
00:00:21.951 --> 00:00:26.994
"My turn is next week," Brandy thought nervously.

5
00:00:28.314 --> 00:00:30.856
Last Monday Kara brought her iguana.

6
00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:35.482
The week before, Miyuki performed a magic trick.

7
00:00:35.502 --> 00:00:40.785
"I don't have any pets or hobbies," Brandy thought.

8
00:00:40.805 --> 00:00:42.726
"What can I show?"

9
00:00:44.987 --> 00:00:47.108
That weekend Brandy was quiet.

10
00:00:47.128 --> 00:00:50.850
"Is something wrong?"

11
00:00:51.330 --> 00:00:52.091
Mom asked.

12
00:00:55.112 --> 00:00:57.534
"What should I do for show-and-tell on Monday?"

13
00:00:58.034 --> 00:00:58.914
Brandy asked.

14
00:00:58.934 --> 00:01:01.716
"Hmm," Mom said.

15
00:01:02.976 --> 00:01:04.637
"You're good at many things."

16
00:01:04.657 --> 00:01:07.178
"Like what?"

17
00:01:07.798 --> 00:01:08.659
Brandy asked.

18
00:01:08.679 --> 00:01:14.281
"Like math and Mom pointed to a shelf.

19
00:01:14.301 --> 00:01:17.222
"Can you please get that jar for me?"

20
00:01:19.543 --> 00:01:23.165
"Sure!" Brandy was always ready to help Mom.

21
00:01:24.465 --> 00:01:27.287
Three years ago Mom was in a car accident.

22
00:01:28.447 --> 00:01:29.888
Now she used a wheelchair.

23
00:01:31.556 --> 00:01:33.317
Mom could do a lot for herself.

24
00:01:34.277 --> 00:01:36.537
But sometimes she needed Brandy's help.

25
00:01:38.958 --> 00:01:40.599
Brandy handed Mom the jar.

26
00:01:40.619 --> 00:01:43.759
"Thanks," Mom said.

27
00:01:43.779 --> 00:01:49.821
"Back to show-and-tell She reminded Brandy of some things Brandy liked to do.

28
00:01:51.001 --> 00:01:54.002
Brandy did enjoy drawing and playing soccer.

29
00:01:54.983 --> 00:01:59.864
But nothing felt quite right for show-and-tell until Sunday night!

30
00:02:03.816 --> 00:02:06.837
In school the next day, Brandy felt worried.

31
00:02:08.097 --> 00:02:11.938
When it was time for show-and-tell, she looked nervously at the door.

32
00:02:11.958 --> 00:02:16.160
"I hope this was a good idea," she thought.

33
00:02:16.180 --> 00:02:19.861
"It's your turn, Brandy," Mr.

34
00:02:19.881 --> 00:02:20.881
Francesco said.

35
00:02:22.341 --> 00:02:23.662
She looked at the door again.

36
00:02:23.682 --> 00:02:29.583
"I, um, maybe—" "Hello!"

37
00:02:30.484 --> 00:02:31.604
The door opened.

38
00:02:32.736 --> 00:02:33.657
"Sorry I'm late!"

39
00:02:34.157 --> 00:02:35.218
Brandy's mom said.

40
00:02:35.238 --> 00:02:39.822
"Phew!" Brandy thought.

41
00:02:40.782 --> 00:02:42.444
She joined Mom near Mr.

42
00:02:42.484 --> 00:02:43.625
Francesco's desk.

43
00:02:43.645 --> 00:02:47.948
"I'm going to talk about my mom today," Brandy said.

44
00:02:47.968 --> 00:02:52.412
"As you can see, she uses a very cool wheelchair.

45
00:02:53.372 --> 00:02:55.454
There are lots of things she can do with it."

46
00:02:57.095 --> 00:03:00.478
Brandy's mom demonstrated going forward and backward.

47
00:03:01.279 --> 00:03:02.420
Then she did a spin.

48
00:03:04.524 --> 00:03:05.785
The class clapped.

49
00:03:05.805 --> 00:03:10.889
"The wheelchair makes her life much easier," Brandy said.

50
00:03:10.909 --> 00:03:15.112
"Something else makes my life easier."

51
00:03:15.952 --> 00:03:17.393
Mom beamed at Brandy.

52
00:03:17.413 --> 00:03:21.096
"My daughter helps me all the time!"

53
00:03:21.116 --> 00:03:23.998
The class started clapping again.

54
00:03:24.978 --> 00:03:27.100
This time it was for Brandy.

55
00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:30.722
"What an interesting show-and-tell!"

56
00:03:31.203 --> 00:03:32.524
Mr. Francesco said.

57
00:03:33.644 --> 00:03:35.727
"Brandy, that was a wonderful idea!"

58
00:03:37.128 --> 00:03:39.831
Brandy grinned and then hugged Mom.
